13px&quot;&gt;AI red teaming&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#5B6472;font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;~110 attack conversations&lt;br&gt;Prohibited actions: 0% may&lt;br&gt;succeed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C05621;strokeWidth=1.2;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="452" y="492" width="206" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n39" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#C05621;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Approval packet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#5B6472;font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;GitHub issue + run summary&lt;br&gt;Results, failing cases,&lt;br&gt;anything flagged&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C05621;strokeWidth=1.2;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="684" y="492" width="206" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n40" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#C05621;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Human approval&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#5B6472;font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;Prod reviewer reads the&lt;br&gt;packet → Approve or Reject&lt;br&gt;with a comment&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C05621;strokeWidth=1.2;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916" y="492" width="206" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n41" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#2F855A;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Deploy to prod → Live ✓&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#5B6472;font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;Same agent definition&lt;br&gt;Same smoke checks&lt;br&gt;opgagentprod&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5EC;strokeColor=#2F855A;strokeWidth=1.2;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1148" y="492" width="206" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n42" value="&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#C05621;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="480" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n43" value="&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#C05621;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="904" y="480" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n44" value="" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeWidth=1.6;strokeColor=#C05621;fontSize=10;fontColor=#C05621;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n37" target="n38"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n45" value="" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeWidth=1.6;strokeColor=#C05621;fontSize=10;fontColor=#C05621;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n38" target="n39"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n46" value="" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeWidth=1.6;strokeColor=#C05621;fontSize=10;fontColor=#C05621;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n39" target="n40"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n47" value="" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeWidth=1.6;strokeColor=#C05621;fontSize=10;fontColor=#C05621;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n40" target="n41"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n48" value="✕ attack succeeds → blocked" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDECEC;strokeColor=#C53030;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#C53030;fontSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="600" width="150" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n49" value="✕ rejected → nothing deployed" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDECEC;strokeColor=#C53030;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#C53030;fontSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="944" y="600" width="150" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n50" value="↻ smoke fails → auto-rollback" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDECEC;strokeColor=#C53030;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#C53030;fontSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1166" y="600" width="170" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n51" value="✓ reusable" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5EC;strokeColor=#2F855A;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2F855A;fontSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="574" y="482" width="76" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n52" value="when dev looks good" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeWidth=1.6;strokeColor=#9AA3B2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#9AA3B2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n22" target="n37"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1251.0" y="456"/><mxPoint x="323.0" y="456"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n53" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#C53030;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;When something fails&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#5B6472;font-size:11px;line-height:1.4&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fail closed&lt;/b&gt;: errors, missing results or too few cases block. They never pass.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;A real miss is not retried.&lt;/b&gt; Fix the agent or a wrong test, then open a new PR or tag.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px&quot;&gt;A judge error (e.g. rate limit) is re-scored at most twice; if still unscored, it blocks.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px&quot;&gt;The approval packet is always built, so the team sees why a release is blocked.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E2E6EC;strokeWidth=1;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingTop=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="662" width="660" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n54" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#2F855A;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Guardrails&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#5B6472;font-size:11px;line-height:1.4&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Prod&lt;/b&gt;: required reviewer, no admin bypass, only &lt;i&gt;shift-manager-v*&lt;/i&gt; tags, OIDC login (no secrets in code).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Red team&lt;/b&gt; runs on releases only; REVIEW = passes but is flagged for the approver.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reuse&lt;/b&gt;: dev version, evaluation and red-team scan are reused when nothing changed; force with &lt;i&gt;force_eval&lt;/i&gt; / &lt;i&gt;force_redteam&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px&quot;&gt;Manual &lt;i&gt;Run workflow&lt;/i&gt; builds a packet but never deploys prod.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E2E6EC;strokeWidth=1;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingTop=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="710" y="662" width="660" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>